1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,522
Protein siapa

2
00:00:00,522 --> 00:00:01,511
yang lebih tinggi?

3
00:00:01,511 --> 00:00:02,377
Tempe...

4
00:00:02,377 --> 00:00:03,095
atau telur?

5
00:00:04,265 --> 00:00:05,430
Jawabannya...

6
00:00:05,430 --> 00:00:06,126
TEMPE!

7
00:00:06,126 --> 00:00:06,911
Per seratus gram,

8
00:00:06,911 --> 00:00:08,358
tempe dua puluh gram protein,

9
00:00:08,358 --> 00:00:09,930
telur cuma dua belas!

10
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:12,695
Tapi awas, ada jebakan angka...

11
00:00:12,695 --> 00:00:13,842
di akhir video.

12
00:00:13,842 --> 00:00:15,123
Rahasianya?

13
00:00:15,123 --> 00:00:15,864
Kedelai,

14
00:00:15,864 --> 00:00:17,347
kacang yang kaya protein.

15
00:00:17,347 --> 00:00:18,829
Lalu difermentasi

16
00:00:18,829 --> 00:00:20,847
jamur Rhizopus...

17
00:00:20,847 --> 00:00:22,201
jadi lebih gampang dicerna!

18
00:00:22,201 --> 00:00:23,593
Nah, ini jebakannya:

19
00:00:23,593 --> 00:00:25,924
angka tadi per seratus gram.

20
00:00:25,924 --> 00:00:28,638
Sebutir telur: tujuh koma enam gram.

21
00:00:28,638 --> 00:00:30,013
Sepotong tempe tipis:

22
00:00:30,013 --> 00:00:32,308
cuma lima koma satu gram!

23
00:00:32,308 --> 00:00:33,545
Jadi...

24
00:00:33,545 --> 00:00:35,784
makan tempenya dua potong!

25
00:00:35,784 --> 00:00:37,959
Tempe: murah, asli Indonesia,

26
00:00:37,959 --> 00:00:40,378
tercatat sejak tahun seribu delapan ratusan!

27
00:00:40,378 --> 00:00:41,091
Kirim ke temanmu

28
00:00:41,091 --> 00:00:43,811
yang suka meremehkan tempe!

